  "What the hell?\nI think I'm starting to sober up.": "",
  "Huh? How'd I end up here?": "",
  "Heheh! Getting hammered\nwith you is always a trip!": "",
  "My friend here's a lightweight,\nbut I can go all niiight!": "",
  "*belch* Anybody else staaarving?": "",
  "Startin' the feel\na little bit like crap...": "",
  "Damn, that girl\nwash *hic* beautiful...": "",
  "Thank you for another\ndelicious alcohol!": "",
  "You're quite the\nboozehound, aren't you!?": "",
  "Never trusht a man who\ncan't hold hish alcohol...": "",
  "Haw haw hawww!!!": "",
  "Gahaha! I'll grow on ya! *hic*": "",
  "Drinks here are tasty, cheap,\nand getcha fucked up quick!": "",
  "*yawn* I could sure go\nfor a nap. Maybe... right here...": "",
  "Let's hit up the same bar\nwe did last time!": "",
  "Gah! The hell'd you put\nin that bottle? Sword polish?": "",
  "I, uh... I need to\nlie down for a bit...": "",
  "*hic* Where were we going again?": "",
  "I ain't eeeven drunk!": "",
  "*sigh* Aaah...": "",
  "Pace yourself, boss, okay?": "",
  "More drinksh! For me\nand everybody here!": "",
  "Naw, naw, I can\ndrink plenty more!": "",
  "I can shtill keep drinkin'!": "",
  "Shame on you all! I can keep\ndrinking till sunrise!": "",
  "I'm a drinking legend!\nHistory will tell my tale!": "",
  "*hic* Heheheh! *hic*": "",
  "Come on!\nLet's drink till we die!": "",
  "Alcohol'sh the one thing\nin thish world I trusht!": "",
  "You drunk already!?\nYou got some kinda baby liver?": "",
  "Are you drunk already!\nHa! That's a riot!": "",
  "I drank away my last coin...": "",
  "Have I reached the\nlimits of drunkenness?": "",
  "I'll never drink again, I swear!": "",
  "More drinks! More drinks!": "",
  "I am the god of booooze!": "",
  "Lemme get another\none of them there drinks!": "",
  "Weeeee!!!": "",
  "*hiccup*": "",
  "Anybody else hungry as hell?": "",
  "There're worse things\nthan drinking with a friend...": "",
  "Kyo girls ain't like\nany other girls! Heheh!": "",
  "We're drinking all night, baby!": "",
  "Mmm...\nI'll be sleeping well tonight.": "",
  "Pricier drinks don't get\nyou a pricier drunk, I say!": "",
  "Time to get home and make\nsweet, passionate love! *belch*": "",
  "Hoo baby! I'm feelin'\ngooood tonight!": "",
  "What's in this? Whatever it is,\nI love drinkin' it!": "",
  "My body runs on one hundred\npercent pure grain alcohol!": "",
  "Come one, come all! Bear your\nswords! *hic* I'll never die!": "",
  "I can drink all night!\nI'm a fish! A fish I tells ya!": "",
  "I'm haaappy!!! *hiccup*": "",
  "I'm gonna drink every fuckin'\ndrink you got in there!": "",
  "Oh yeah—he's wasted, that one!": "",
  "Bring on the *hic* shochu!": "",
  "I drink by the barrelfull!": "",
  "Where to next,\nmighty steeds!? *hic*": "",
  "The night is young!\n*hic* Where to next!?": "",
  "I'm gonna close my eyes\nand walk until I hit another tavern!": "",
  "All this walking's\ntoo much for tipsy feet!": "",
  "Heehee! *hiccup*": ""
